# Linear-symmetry SCF in the complex basis of e^{im phi} functions,
# restricted hybrid DFT; the energy equals erkale's.
System N2.xyz
Basis cc-pVDZ
Method hyb_gga_xc_b3lyp
Multiplicity 1
Restricted true
ComplexBasis true
JKMethod Cholesky
DFTGrid 75 -302
# The converged orbital gradient lands near 1e-8 (7.8e-9 typically),
# and some runs do not get below; the energy is checked to 1e-7 or less
ConvThr 1e-7
SaveChk complex_orbs_n2_b3lyp.chk
